 {
  "h": "1b5tdl9",
  "k": "A man said, \"I did not realise, and shaved before slaughtering.\" He ﷺ said: \"Slaughter now, there is no harm.\" Another: \"I did not realise, and slaughtered before stoning.\" — \"Stone now, there is no harm.\" — Bukhari {1}",
