 {
  "h": "8v7xno",
  "k": "A woman lifted up a child and asked, \"Is there Hajj for this one?\" The Prophet ﷺ said: \"Yes, and you will have a reward.\" — Sahih Muslim. A child's Umrah is valid and rewarded; a guardian makes the intention for a small child.",
